      "writtenOn": "2020-11-25T00:31:25Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "So the argument is don\u0027t spend the cycles converting the `voltha` script to have \"infra\" and \"stack\" focused commands because we will be moving to helm centric? If so, doesn\u0027t the question become should we just do that now and skip this patch?",
